      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "I only ever found one character to be really viable to play as",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198167617508/recommended/2644610/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "许多机制缺少清楚说明。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "so many things were not properly explained",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198167617508/recommended/2644610/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "除某一原创点外，玩法缺少足够新意",
